# Start: a transfer page, focus on SAVES, with ROMS AND BIOS or GAME CONTENT
# on (so the second button reads CONTINUE). End: the systems page, focus on
# SELECT ALL. Four rows down is the button bar on BACK; right is CONTINUE;
# the scan behind the page takes a few seconds.
key down
wait 1
key down
wait 1
key down
wait 1
key down
wait 1
key right
wait 1
shot continue-focused
key x
wait 7
shot systems-page
